   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "On motion to recommit with instructions Failed by recorded vote: 181 - 228 (Roll no. 216).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8A000",
   "actionDate": "2019-05-17",
   "actionTime": "11:58:21",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question on the motion to recommit with instructions was ordered without objection.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2019-05-17",
   "actionTime": "11:48:02",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Steube motion to recommit with instructions. The instructions contained in the motion seek to require the bill to be reported back to the House with an amendment to add at the end of the bill a new section that nothing in this Act or any amendment made by this Act may be construed to diminish any protections under title IX of the Education Amendments of 1972.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "2019-05-17",
   "actionTime": "11:47:45",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Judiciary Committee",
     "systemCode": "hsju00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hsju00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Steube moved to recommit with instructions to the Committee on the Judiciary. (text: CR H3950)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2019-05-17",
   "actionTime": "11:46:58",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H3950-3953)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2019-05-17",
   "actionTime": "11:22:48",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - Pursuant to clause 1(c) of Rule 19, the Chair postponed further proceedings on H.R. 5.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "2019-05-17",
   "actionTime": "11:22:21",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2019-05-17",
   "actionTime": "09:18:12",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with 90 minutes of debate on H.R. 5.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2019-05-17",
   "actionTime": "09:17:12",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 5, H.R. 312 and H.R. 987. The resolution provides for 90 minutes of debate on H.R. 5, under a closed rule. Section 2 of the resolution provides for 60 minutes of debate on H.R. 312, under a closed rule and section 3 provides 90 minutes of debate on H.R. 987, under a structured rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2019-05-17",
   "actionTime": "09:17:07",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 377. (consideration: CR H3931-3950)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
   "actionDate": "2019-05-14",
   "actionTime": "20:32:15",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 377 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 5, H.R. 312 and H.R. 987. The resolution provides for 90 minutes of debate on H.R. 5, under a closed rule. Section 2 of the resolution provides for 60 minutes of debate on H.R. 312, under a closed rule and section 3 provides 90 minutes of debate on H.R. 987, under a structured rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
